  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 1,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**08 \u00b7 Tokens and permissions.** Every gRPC call carries `authorization: Bearer <JWT>`. The cluster's SecurityManager (`security/`) checks the token (**UNAUTHENTICATED** if it's missing, expired or forged) and whether one of its `perms` implies what the call needs (**PERMISSION_DENIED** if not). The grpc-go client acts as alice, bob, carol or nobody. Fill the panels with `make select-load-test EX=08 SCRIPT=auth/mixed`."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Who got in: each user's calls by result",
      "id": 2,
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "id": 3,
      "title": "alice: DATA:READ, DATA:WRITE (everything)",
      "description": "Share of alice's gRPC calls by status code over the time range, from the client's interceptor (demo_calls_total). Includes the demo's calls.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (code) (increase(demo_calls_total{user=\"alice\"}[$__range])) / scalar(sum(increase(demo_calls_total{user=\"alice\"}[$__range])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{code}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
