      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "| user | token `perms` | gets |\n|---|---|---|\n| alice | `DATA:READ`, `DATA:WRITE` | everything |\n| bob | `DATA:READ` | reads; writes \u2192 PERMISSION_DENIED |\n| carol | `DATA:READ:orders`, `DATA:WRITE:orders` | orders; customers \u2192 PERMISSION_DENIED |\n| none | (no token) | UNAUTHENTICATED |\n\nGet/Query need `DATA:READ`, Put/Remove `DATA:WRITE`, GetAndPut and the other GetAnd* both. The server checks them per region and key, e.g. `DATA:WRITE:orders:grpc-go:42`."
      },
      "transparent": true
